        "unit_id": "scripts/mp_common/gametypes/battlechatter.gsc::function_f5c48bfa",
        "behavior": "Non-dev battlechatter specialist dialog for enemy-destroyed gadget/equipment: gates in order - level.allowspecialistdialog true; attacker defined and isplayer and lacks perk specialty_quieter; gadgetweapon defined and NOT (owner defined and owner==attacker); attackerweapon (when defined) is not a killstreak weapon (killstreaks::get_from_weapon undefined); attacker has an mpdialog_player bundle; switch on gadgetweapon.name across 14 equipment identities (eq_sensor, gadget_spawnbeacon, claymore, eq_concertina_wire, gun_mini_turret, dog_ai_defaultmelee, seeker_mine_arc, ability_smart_cover, gadget_supplypod, eq_tripwire, trophy_system, eq_emp_grenade, eq_hawk, eq_shroud) with default return; on match threads function_5896274(mpdialog_value(enemyKillDelay,0), dialogkey, 2, undefined, undefined, cancel_kill_dialog) and for seeker_mine_arc additionally function_a43a3519. HMH-path limit: level. [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
        "unknowns": [
          "Original-build presence of battlechatter in the warzone VM and the runtime value of allowbattlechatter/enableherodialog for warzone_heavy_metal_heroes",
